<title>JAPAN: Asahi Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		516.96		vs	  487.60</p>
<p> Operating	   21.22		vs	   18.99</p>
<p> Current	     19.45		vs	   16.52</p>
<p> Net		    7.38		vs	    5.13</p>
<p> EPS		    5.12 yen	  vs	    3.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.44 billion	  vs	1.44 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Chemical Industry Co Ltd is a leading manufacturer of synthetic fibres.</p>
</text>
